INTERLIS 2.4; CONTRACTED MODEL M AT "https://example.org" VERSION "1" = TOPIC T = CLASS S EXTENDS INTERLIS.SIGN = PARAMETER A: MANDATORY 0..10; END S; CLASS Derived EXTENDS S = PARAMETER B: MANDATORY 0..10; END Derived; CLASS Other EXTENDS INTERLIS.SIGN = END Other; END T; SIGN BASKET Library ~ T OBJECTS OF S: Dot; TOPIC Data = CLASS C = x: TEXT; END C; GRAPHIC G BASED ON C = Draw OF M.T.Derived: (Sign := {Dot}; A := 1; B := 2); END G; END Data; END M.